          "from old. First: -w-, the passive.",
          "",
          "   kupa      to give",
          "   kupewa    to be given",
          "",
          "   Nilipewa zawadi.",
          "   I was given a gift.",
          "",
          "   kukamata -> kukamatwa",
          "   Mwizi alikamatwa jana.",
          "   The thief was caught yesterday.",
          "",
          "Hear them:                         Press 1"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Kupewa. Nilipewa zawadi. Mwizi alikamatwa jana."
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "The doer, if named, arrives with na:",
          "",
          "   Alikamatwa na askari.",
          "   He was caught by a soldier.",
          "",
          "Vowel-ending roots take -liwa/-lewa:",
          "",
          "   kufungua -> kufunguliwa  to be opened",
          "   kutoa    -> kutolewa     to be issued",
          "",
          "Hear them:                         Press 1",
          "",
          "These are not forms of one verb but",
          "VERBS in their own right — each with",
          "its own card in this pack. That is",
          "the P2 idea entire: derivation",
          "builds the dictionary."
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
