        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "The subject is naturally plural —",
          "each-othering needs company:",
          "",
          "   Viongozi walikutana jana.",
          "   The leaders met yesterday.",
          "",
          "   Mataifa yanafahamiana.",
          "   The nations know one another.",
          "",
